DMC100-Doom engine patches
==========================

dmc100-qwenos-merged.patch is a unified diff (text only) of the edits QwenOS makes
to the DMC100-Doom engine, relative to pristine upstream:

    https://github.com/ArturBieniek4/DMC100-Doom   (commit 0cdc78e)

DMC100-Doom is licensed GPL-2.0 and descends from doomgeneric and id Software's
DOOM source (GPL). This patch is a derivative work of those sources and is
distributed under GPL-2.0 as well. It contains no WAD data.

Apply it to a checkout of upstream (the QwenOS build expects it at .deps/engine/DMC100-Doom; tools/fetch_engine.sh does all of this):

    git clone https://github.com/ArturBieniek4/DMC100-Doom .deps/engine/DMC100-Doom
    cd .deps/engine/DMC100-Doom && git checkout 0cdc78e
    patch -p1 < ../../<this repo>/engine-patches/dmc100-qwenos-merged.patch
